---
/*
 * Type lab — Recursive.
 *
 * Dev-only specimen. Not part of the production build's design system;
 * it exists to judge a variable-font replacement for Necto Mono before
 * committing to it. Delete or gate behind an env flag before merging to main.
 *
 * What it shows, and why each section exists:
 *  - Real copy at real sizes: your h1, a project title, a CV line. Not lorem.
 *  - Necto baseline beside Recursive, so you see what you lose.
 *  - Four driveable axes (MONO, CASL, wght, slnt) with sliders.
 *  - Four choreography presets, replayable on click, each illustrating a
 *    different "life" the headings could have.
 *  - Reduced-motion toggle: what a prefers-reduced-motion visitor sees.
 *  - Still frames at 0/25/50/75/100% for judging intermediate glyph shapes.
 *  - The specimen over a field-simulated background, so you see it against
 *    the purple/white context the real site lives in.
 */
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>type lab — Recursive | wolfw.xyz</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Recursive:slnt,wght,CASL,MONO@-15..0,300..1000,0..1,0..1&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/Necto-Mono.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <style>
      @import "../styles/tokens.css";
    </style>
    <style>
      /* Lab chrome — deliberately outside global.css, not part of the system. */
      :root {
        --lab-mono: 0;
        --lab-casl: 0;
        --lab-wght: 400;
        --lab-slnt: 0;
        --lab-grid: #ececec;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { background: #f6f0ff; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
        color: #111;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      a { color: inherit; }
      /* Header */
      .lab-header {
        max-width: 980px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 1rem;
      }
      .lab-header h1 {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0.3, "wght" 700, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .lab-header p.lead {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: #444;
        max-width: 62ch;
        margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
      }
      .lab-header .meta {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: #777;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      .lab-header .meta code { font-size: 0.92em; background: #eee; padding: 0.1em 0.3em; border-radius: 3px; }
      /* Section shell */
      .lab-section {
        max-width: 980px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.6rem 1.25rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--lab-grid);
        background: #fff;
      }
      .lab-section h2 {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0, "wght" 700, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #6b4db3;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
      }
      .lab-section h3 {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 1.4rem 0 0.5rem;
        color: #222;
      }
      .lab-note {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: #666;
        max-width: 68ch;
        margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .lab-note strong { color: #222; }
      /* Playground */
      .playground-preview {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings:
          "MONO" var(--lab-mono),
          "CASL" var(--lab-casl),
          "wght" var(--lab-wght),
          "slnt" var(--lab-slnt);
        font-size: var(--fs-display-fluid);
        line-height: var(--lh-tight);
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2.2rem 1rem;
        background: #fbfaf8;
        border: 1px solid var(--lab-grid);
        border-radius: 8px;
        min-height: 7.5rem;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        /* for entrance presets */
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      }
      .playground-preview.is-animating {
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      }
      .playground-preview span.char {
        display: inline-block;
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      }
      .controls {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem 1.4rem;
        margin-top: 1.2rem;
      }
      .control label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #555;
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      }
      .control .row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; }
      .control input[type="range"] { flex: 1; accent-color: #6b4db3; }
      .control output {
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        min-width: 3.2ch;
        text-align: right;
        color: #222;
      }
      .control .hint { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #888; margin-top: 0.15rem; }
      .code {
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        background: #111;
        color: #d8d8d8;
        padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      /* Presets */
      .presets {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        margin: 0.8rem 0 0.4rem;
      }
      .preset-btn {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0, "wght" 600, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
        border: 1px solid #222;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 3px 3px #000;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: box-shadow 0.18s, transform 0.18s;
      }
      .preset-btn:hover { box-shadow: 1px 1px #000; transform: translate(1px, 1px); }
      .preset-btn:active { box-shadow: none; transform: translate(3px, 3px); }
      .preset-btn small { display: block; font-size: 0.68rem; color: #666; font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0, "wght" 400, "slnt" 0; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
      /* Comparison */
      .compare {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 0.6rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 640px) { .compare { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
      .compare-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--lab-grid);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1.2rem 1rem;
        background: #fbfaf8;
      }
      .compare-card .label {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #888;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      }
      .compare-card .specimen {
        font-size: var(--fs-display-fluid);
        line-height: var(--lh-tight);
        text-align: center;
      }
      .compare-card .specimen.necto { font-family: var(--font-display); }
      .compare-card .specimen.recursive {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0.15, "wght" 650, "slnt" 0;
      }
      .compare-card .sub {
        margin-top: 0.7rem;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: #555;
        line-height: 1.6;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .compare-card .sub em { font-style: normal; color: #222; font-weight: 600; }
      /* Real content specimens */
      .specimen-row {
        border: 1px solid var(--lab-grid);
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
      }
      .specimen-row .row-label {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #888;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem 0;
      }
      .specimen-row .row-preview {
        padding: 1rem 0.9rem 1.2rem;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .specimen-row .row-preview h3.recursive-h {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0.15, "wght" 700, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: var(--fs-h1);
        line-height: var(--lh-tight);
        margin: 0;
      }
      .specimen-row .row-preview h3.necto-h {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: var(--fs-h1);
        line-height: var(--lh-tight);
        margin: 0;
      }
      .specimen-row .row-preview p {
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
        font-size: var(--fs-body);
        line-height: var(--lh-body);
        color: #333;
        max-width: var(--measure-text);
        margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
      }
      .specimen-row .row-preview .meta-line {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0, "wght" 500, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: var(--fs-caption);
        color: #666;
        margin-top: 0.35rem;
      }
      /* Still frames */
      .frames {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
        gap: 0.6rem;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 700px) { .frames { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
      .frame {
        border: 1px solid var(--lab-grid);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 0.7rem 0.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        background: #fbfaf8;
      }
      .frame .pct { font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
      .frame .glyph {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.9rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }
      /* Home simulation */
      .home-sim {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--lab-grid);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #bc89ff;
        padding: 0.9rem;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
      }
      .home-sim .sheet {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 1.6rem 1rem 1.4rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .home-sim .sheet h1 {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0.15, "wght" 700, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: var(--fs-display-fluid);
        margin: 0;
        line-height: var(--lh-tight);
      }
      .home-sim .sheet p {
        font-size: var(--fs-lead);
        line-height: var(--lh-fact);
        margin: 0.7rem auto 0;
        max-width: 28ch;
      }
      .home-sim .sheet .btns {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        max-width: 520px;
        margin: 1rem auto 0;
      }
      .home-sim .sheet .btns span {
        display: block;
        border: 1px solid #000;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 3px 3px #000;
        padding: 0.6rem;
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0, "wght" 600, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }
      /* Cost box */
      .cost {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.8rem;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
      }
      .cost-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--lab-grid);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem;
        background: #fbfaf8;
      }
      .cost-card strong { display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
      .cost-card span { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #555; }
      .cost-card code { font-size: 0.78rem; background: #eee; padding: 0.1em 0.3em; border-radius: 3px; }
      /* Reduced motion */
      .toggle-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }
      .toggle-row input { accent-color: #6b4db3; }
      /* Constant slow breath — whole heading, all axes drifting.
         Stable: MONO stays 1 so phrase size never changes (your last note).
         Only CASL/wght/slnt move — the word breathes without growing. 8.4s. */
      @keyframes monoBreatheSlow {
        0%   { font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0,    "wght" 520, "slnt" 0; }
        25%  { font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0.18, "wght" 580, "slnt" -1.5; }
        50%  { font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0.38, "wght" 620, "slnt" -3; }
        75%  { font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0.2,  "wght" 580, "slnt" -1; }
        100% { font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0,    "wght" 520, "slnt" 0; }
      }
      .playground-preview.constant-breathe,
      #presetPreview.constant-breathe,
      #homeH1.constant-breathe {
        animation: monoBreatheSlow 8.4s cubic-bezier(0.45, 0, 0.55, 1) infinite;
      }
      /* Per-letter slow wave — same breathe, staggered per glyph. MONO stays 1. */
      @keyframes monoWave {
        0%   { font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0,    "wght" 520, "slnt" 0; }
        50%  { font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0.38, "wght" 620, "slnt" -3; }
        100% { font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0,    "wght" 520, "slnt" 0; }
      }
      .playground-preview.constant-wave span.char,
      #presetPreview.constant-wave span.char,
      #homeH1.constant-wave span.char {
        animation: monoWave 8.4s cubic-bezier(0.45, 0, 0.55, 1) infinite;
      }
      /* Hover — transform on hover. Mono 1 → 0.51, so glyphs never switch past 0.5.
         Whole heading: one transition. Per-letter: staggered transitions. */
      .hover-breathe {
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.72s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
        cursor: default;
      }
      .hover-breathe:hover {
        /* stable: MONO stays 1 so phrase never changes length */
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0.28, "wght" 580, "slnt" -1;
      }
      .hover-wave { cursor: default; }
      .hover-wave span.char {
        display: inline-block;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.62s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
      }
      .hover-wave:hover span.char {
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0.28, "wght" 580, "slnt" -1;
      }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .hover-breathe, .hover-wave span.char { transition: none !important; }
        .hover-breathe:hover, .hover-wave:hover span.char {
          font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0 !important;
        }
      }
      .lab-section.simulate-reduced .playground-preview.constant-breathe,
      .lab-section.simulate-reduced #presetPreview.constant-breathe,
      .lab-section.simulate-reduced #homeH1.constant-breathe,
      .lab-section.simulate-reduced .playground-preview.constant-wave span.char,
      .lab-section.simulate-reduced #presetPreview.constant-wave span.char,
      .lab-section.simulate-reduced #homeH1.constant-wave span.char {
        animation: none !important;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.75, "CASL" 0.12, "wght" 580, "slnt" -1 !important;
      }
      /* When reduced-motion simulation is on, kill transitions */
      .lab-section.simulate-reduced * {
        transition: none !important;
        animation: none !important;
      }
      .lab-footer {
        max-width: 980px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.2rem 1.25rem 2.5rem;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: #777;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--lab-grid);
        background: #fff;
      }
      .lab-footer a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .playground-preview, .playground-preview span.char { transition: none !important; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="lab-header">
      <h1>Recursive — type lab</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        A variable-font replacement for Necto Mono, judged with your real copy at your real sizes.
        Five axes: <code>MONO</code> 0→1 · <code>CASL</code> 0→1 · <code>wght</code> 300→1000 · <code>slnt</code> −15→0.
        Latin subset 55&thinsp;KB vs Necto 25&thinsp;KB. Arrow Type / Stephen Nixon, SIL OFL.
      </p>
      <p class="meta">
        Dev-only specimen — not part of the production build. Delete or gate before merging to <code>main</code>.
        Specimen copy is real: <code>wolfw.xyz</code> · <code>Visualizing government</code> · CV line.
        &nbsp; <a href="/">← back to site</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- 1 — Necto vs Recursive -->
    <section class="lab-section">
      <h2>1 — What you lose, what you gain</h2>
      <p class="lab-note">
        Necto is static — one instance, zero axes. Its charm is fixed. Recursive can be the same mono you have
        (<code>MONO 1, CASL 0</code>) or something else entirely. The question is whether the range is worth the
        30&thinsp;KB and a second display family.
      </p>
      <div class="compare">
        <div class="compare-card">
          <div class="label">Necto Mono — today (static, 25 KB)</div>
          <div class="specimen necto">wolfw.xyz</div>
          <div class="sub"><em>One instance.</em> Quirky, bitmap-ish, the site's one distinctive asset. Charming at display size, harder at reading size. No axes — nothing to animate.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="compare-card">
          <div class="label">Recursive — proportional, Linear (MONO 0 / CASL 0)</div>
          <div class="specimen recursive">wolfw.xyz</div>
          <div class="sub"><em>Same string, contemporary.</em> Proportional, rational, calm. This is the settled state if you replace Necto — not the animation, the thing that stays.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="compare" style="margin-top:1rem">
        <div class="compare-card">
          <div class="label">Recursive — Monospace, Linear (MONO 1 / CASL 0)</div>
          <div class="specimen recursive" style="font-variation-settings: 'MONO' 1, 'CASL' 0, 'wght' 550, 'slnt' 0">wolfw.xyz</div>
          <div class="sub">Mono heritage intact. If the mono <em>is</em> the identity, this is where Recursive can still be that — and then breathe out of it.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="compare-card">
          <div class="label">Recursive — Proportional, Casual (MONO 0 / CASL 1)</div>
          <div class="specimen recursive" style="font-variation-settings: 'MONO' 0, 'CASL' 1, 'wght' 550, 'slnt' 0">wolfw.xyz</div>
          <div class="sub">Curved terminals, softer, more energetic. A different site — worth seeing so you know what you're <em>not</em> choosing if you stay Linear.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2 — Axis playground -->
    <section class="lab-section" id="playground">
      <h2>2 — Axis playground</h2>
      <p class="lab-note">Drag any axis. The preview is live — and the code block shows the exact <code>font-variation-settings</code> you'd ship.</p>
      <div class="playground-preview" id="playgroundPreview">wolfw.xyz</div>
      <div class="controls">
        <div class="control">
          <label for="sMono">MONO — Monospace</label>
          <div class="row"><input id="sMono" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0" /><output id="oMono">0.00</output></div>
          <div class="hint">0 proportional → 1 monospace</div>
        </div>
        <div class="control">
          <label for="sCasl">CASL — Casual</label>
          <div class="row"><input id="sCasl" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.15" /><output id="oCasl">0.15</output></div>
          <div class="hint">0 Linear → 1 Casual</div>
        </div>
        <div class="control">
          <label for="sWght">wght — Weight</label>
          <div class="row"><input id="sWght" type="range" min="300" max="1000" step="1" value="650" /><output id="oWght">650</output></div>
          <div class="hint">300 → 1000 (default 400)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="control">
          <label for="sSlnt">slnt — Slant</label>
          <div class="row"><input id="sSlnt" type="range" min="-15" max="0" step="0.5" value="0" /><output id="oSlnt">0</output></div>
          <div class="hint">−15 slanted → 0 upright</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <pre class="code" id="codeOut">font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0.15, "wght" 650, "slnt" 0;</pre>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 — Choreography presets -->
    <section class="lab-section" id="presets">
      <h2>3 — Choreography — headings only</h2>
      <p class="lab-note">
        Top row: <strong>entrance</strong> — one shot, settled state <em>is</em> the design. Bottom row:
        <strong>constant, slow</strong> — the mono↔proportional breath looping at 5.2&thinsp;s, the pace you asked for.
        Watch for horizontal wobble on <code>wght</code> — that's the reflow cost of animating weight on centred text.
        Under <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> everything jumps to the settled state.
      </p>
      <div class="playground-preview" id="presetPreview" style="font-variation-settings: 'MONO' 0, 'CASL' 0.15, 'wght' 700, 'slnt' 0">wolfw.xyz</div>
      <div class="presets">
        <button class="preset-btn" data-preset="breathe">Mono breathe <small>MONO 1 → 0 · 800 ms</small></button>
        <button class="preset-btn" data-preset="weight">Gain weight <small>wght 300 → 700 · 800 ms</small></button>
        <button class="preset-btn" data-preset="casual">Linear → Casual <small>CASL 0 → 1 · 800 ms</small></button>
        <button class="preset-btn" data-preset="cascade">Per-char cascade <small>stagger 28 ms · MONO + wght</small></button>
        <button class="preset-btn" data-preset="sweep">Sweep-synced <small>800 ms · same easing as --dur-dash-sweep field</small></button>
      </div>
      <div class="presets" style="margin-top:0.5rem">
        <button class="preset-btn" data-preset="slow-breathe" style="background:#f0eaff;border-color:#6b4db3">Slow breathe — loop <small>MONO 1 ↔ 0.51 · CASL + wght + slnt · 8.4 s</small></button>
        <button class="preset-btn" data-preset="slow-wave" style="background:#f0eaff;border-color:#6b4db3">Slow wave — per letter <small>same 4 axes · staggered · 8.4 s</small></button>
        <button class="preset-btn" data-preset="stop">■ Stop <small>back to settled</small></button>
      </div>
      <p class="lab-note" style="margin-top:0.6rem">
        <strong>What to judge:</strong> does the mono→proportional breath carry meaning (heritage → contemporary)?
        Does weight animation wobble the centred heading? Does <code>CASL</code> add voice or just noise? Is the cascade beautiful or startup-cringe?
        The sweep-synced preset uses the same <code>cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)</code> as the field's R6.4 dash sweep — one arrival, not two.
      </p>
      <div class="toggle-row">
        <input type="checkbox" id="chkReduced" />
        <label for="chkReduced">Simulate <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> — preset buttons jump to the end state, no animation</label>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3b — Hover -->
    <section class="lab-section">
      <h2>3b — Hover — transform on hover</h2>
      <p class="lab-note">
        Hover the headings. Whole heading morphs as one; per-letter staggers one glyph at a time (same 4 axes, MONO 1 → 0.51 so glyphs never switch past the 0.5 threshold you caught). Respects <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> — no transform at all.
      </p>
      <div class="playground-preview hover-breathe" style="font-size: var(--fs-display-fluid)">wolfw.xyz</div>
      <p class="lab-note" style="text-align:center;margin-top:0.4rem">↑ hover — whole heading, 0.72s</p>
      <div class="playground-preview hover-wave" id="hoverWave" style="margin-top:1rem">wolfw.xyz</div>
      <p class="lab-note" style="text-align:center;margin-top:0.4rem">↑ hover — per letter, staggered 54ms, 0.62s each</p>
      <p class="lab-note">Per-letter hover is the wildest one you asked for: each glyph independently on the same 4-axis breathe, so the wave traverses the word as your pointer arrives. Try it on the home poster ↓ too.</p>
      <div class="home-sim">
        <div class="sheet">
          <h1 class="hover-breathe" style="font-family:Recursive,sans-serif;font-size:var(--fs-display-fluid);line-height:var(--lh-tight);margin:0">wolfw.xyz</h1>
          <p>Hi, I'm Wolf W<br />I make web happen — both beautiful and useful.</p>
          <div class="btns"><span>work</span><span>art</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="lab-note" style="text-align:center;margin-top:0.4rem">↑ hover the home h1 — same mono 1 → 0.51, in context</p>
    </section>

    <!-- 4 — Still frames -->
    <section class="lab-section">
      <h2>4 — Still frames — judging the intermediates</h2>
      <p class="lab-note">Type animation is near-impossible to judge in motion, trivial to judge in stills. Each frame is the same string at the same size, only the axis values change.</p>
      <h3>Mono breathe — MONO 1 → 0</h3>
      <div class="frames" id="framesMono"></div>
      <h3>Weight — wght 300 → 700</h3>
      <div class="frames" id="framesWght"></div>
      <h3>CASL — 0 → 1</h3>
      <div class="frames" id="framesCasl"></div>
